---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <section class="page-hero ledger-field">
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:1;">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Accuro</span>
      <h1>Building your future, one smart decision at a time</h1>
      <p class="lede">Accuro Consultancy was founded on a simple belief: every business,
        regardless of size, deserves bespoke financial strategies delivered with
        precision, governance and growth in mind.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div>
          <h2>Our approach</h2>
          <p>We work closely with individuals and businesses across the Maldives —
            from registering a new company to keeping it tax-compliant, funded and
            legally sound. Rather than handing over generic advice, we handle the
            paperwork and the strategy so you can focus on running your business.</p>
          <p>From incorporation documents and corporate bank account setup, to Income
            Tax and GST return submissions, to structuring SDFC financing proposals —
            we bring the same accuracy and care to every engagement.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Why "Accuro"</h2>
          <p>The name reflects our focus on accuracy and care — in the filings we
            prepare, the proposals we structure, and the advice we give. It's a word
            that speaks to precision without losing sight of the people behind the
            business.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">What guides our work</span>
        <h2>Precision. Governance. Growth.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="index">01</span>
          <h3>Precision</h3>
          <p>Every filing, statement and proposal is prepared to be accurate, checked and trusted.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="index">02</span>
          <h3>Governance</h3>
          <p>Compliance and regulatory excellence built into how we work, not an afterthought.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="index">03</span>
          <h3>Growth</h3>
          <p>Advice and funding support aimed at where your business is headed, not just where it is today.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Want to know more about how we work?</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
